# Urban Chopa Stellar Settlement Architecture

## Overview

The system enables Urban Chopa to settle transactions using Stellar.

## Actors

1. Customer
2. Urban Chopa Platform
3. Vendor
4. Stellar Network

## Flow

Customer places order
        ↓
Customer pays Urban Chopa
        ↓
Order is completed
        ↓
Settlement Engine calculates payout
        ↓
Funds are sent to Vendor Wallet
        ↓
Vendor receives settlement

## Components

### Frontend
- Vendor dashboard
- Transaction history

### Backend
- Order management
- Settlement engine
- Stellar integration

### Stellar Layer
- Wallet management
- Transaction processing
- Payment verification

## Future Enhancements

- Automated payouts
